  "description": "Woojin, personality and looks perfect in the eyes of others and even himself. Still, he cannot deny that he is secretly a pervert. Faced with the sudden confession of a \"genius\" photographer; Woojin asks him, \"Can you sleep with me?\".\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/unloving), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/unloving/), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000055297), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9504197), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=230835), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63482238)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://www.lezhin.jp/ja/comic/unloving)",
